  "description": "Invented booking API on Container Apps. An HTTP request wakes it from zero; HTTP rate scales it 1, 4, 8; it returns to zero after the cooldown. Teaching timings: 20 s final-zero cooldown and 30 s scale-down stabilization instead of 300 s.",
